# Runtime credentials and mutable state must never enter an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
/data
/logs
/runtime
/backups
/benchmark-results
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-wal
**/*.sqlite3-shm
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*deploy_key*
**/backend_deploy*
**/*.log
# Audit any additional paths before building. Ignore rules are not secret scanning.
# Deliberately do NOT ignore .git: supervisor updates need the committed main repo.
# Git metadata must contain no embedded credentials or secret historical blobs.
